From 768248d0372025fd9dd05c97bb44f440bf057cb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xavier Geerinck <xavier.geerinck@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:42:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/27] fix(sandbox): make the no-isolation process driver
 opt-in

sandbox.process runs commands as plain host processes, yet it was
compiled into the stable flavor and loaded from any component YAML.

- It is no longer in stablecomponents: only allcomponents builds, or the
  new sandbox_process build tag, include it. The integration test build
  adds that tag, like the other test-only components.
- Init fails unless the metadata allowNoIsolation is "true", in every
  build, with an error that names the key.
- The integration fixtures set the key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
